{"id":"dd3ceef5571a783f","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-group-action-exponentials.md","title":"Definition — 群作用范畴的指数","display":"Definition — 群作用范畴的指数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-group-action-exponentials","aliases":["14-df-group-action-exponentials"],"display":"Definition — 群作用范畴的指数","source_ref":"I, Exercise 5(b), p.62","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-right-group-actions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-group-action-exponentials"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-group-action-exponentials</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 群作用范畴的指数"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I, Exercise 5(b), p.62"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\mu,e,\\iota\">\\(G,\\mu,e,\\iota\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a> 固定的群数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\">\\(X,Y,Z\\)</span> 为该条的带作用对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|,|Y|\">\\(|X|,|Y|\\)</span> 为底集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_G\">\\(b_G\\)</span> 提取箭头的底层函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xg=\\rho_X(x,g)\">\\(xg=\\rho_X(x,g)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)\">\\(h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E)\">\\(k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\operatorname{ev},\\Phi,\\Psi\">\\(E,\\operatorname{ev},\\Phi,\\Psi\\)</span> 为以下构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B=|Y|^{|X|},\\qquad\\rho_E(f,g)=\\bigl(x\\mapsto\\rho_Y(f(\\rho_X(x,g^{-1})),g)\\bigr),\\qquad E=(B,\\rho_E),\\qquad Y^X=E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B=|Y|^{|X|},\\qquad\\rho_E(f,g)=\\bigl(x\\mapsto\\rho_Y(f(\\rho_X(x,g^{-1})),g)\\bigr),\\qquad E=(B,\\rho_E),\\qquad Y^X=E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}=(E\\times_G X,Y,((f,x)\\mapsto f(x))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ev}=(E\\times_G X,Y,((f,x)\\mapsto f(x))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(h)=(Z,E,(z\\mapsto(x\\mapsto b_G(h)(z,x)))),\\qquad\\Psi(k)=(Z\\times_G X,Y,((z,x)\\mapsto b_G(k)(z)(x))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi(h)=(Z,E,(z\\mapsto(x\\mapsto b_G(h)(z,x)))),\\qquad\\Psi(k)=(Z\\times_G X,Y,((z,x)\\mapsto b_G(k)(z)(x))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E),\\qquad\\Psi=\\Phi^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi:\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E),\\qquad\\Psi=\\Phi^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\\Phi=\\operatorname{id},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\operatorname{id}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi\\Phi=\\operatorname{id},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\operatorname{id}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>求值及转置两边都是带源靶的作用范畴箭头；以下逐元素计算均对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_G\">\\(b_G\\)</span> 提取的底层函数进行。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,k\\in G\">\\(g,k\\in G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_E(\\rho_E(f,g),k)(x)=f(xk^{-1}g^{-1})gk=\\rho_E(f,gk)(x)\">\\(\\rho_E(\\rho_E(f,g),k)(x)=f(xk^{-1}g^{-1})gk=\\rho_E(f,gk)(x)\\)</span>，单位律也立即成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是作用对象。求值等变，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_E(f,g)(xg)=f(x)g\">\\(\\rho_E(f,g)(xg)=f(x)g\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 等变，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_G(h)(zg,x)=b_G(h)(z,xg^{-1})g\">\\(b_G(h)(zg,x)=b_G(h)(z,xg^{-1})g\\)</span>，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(h)\">\\(\\Phi(h)\\)</span> 等变的条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi(k)\">\\(\\Psi(k)\\)</span> 的等变性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的等变性及求值等变得到。普通集合函数的柯里化及反柯里化互逆，所以标签固定后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi,\\Psi\">\\(\\Phi,\\Psi\\)</span> 也互逆，并且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,Y\">\\(Z,Y\\)</span> 中箭头自然，证明该构造确是指数。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I, Exercise 5(b), p.62。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,\\mu,e,\\iota$ 是 [[14-df-right-group-actions]] 固定的群数据，$X,Y,Z$ 为该条的带作用对象。$|X|,|Y|$ 为底集，$b_G$ 提取箭头的底层函数，$xg=\\rho_X(x,g)$。$h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)$，$k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E)$。$E,\\operatorname{ev},\\Phi,\\Psi$ 为以下构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\mu,e,\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z","display":false},{"tex":"|X|,|Y|","display":false},{"tex":"b_G","display":false},{"tex":"xg=\\rho_X(x,g)","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E,\\operatorname{ev},\\Phi,\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"B=|Y|^{|X|},\\qquad\\rho_E(f,g)=\\bigl(x\\mapsto\\rho_Y(f(\\rho_X(x,g^{-1})),g)\\bigr),\\qquad E=(B,\\rho_E),\\qquad Y^X=E.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}=(E\\times_G X,Y,((f,x)\\mapsto f(x))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi(h)=(Z,E,(z\\mapsto(x\\mapsto b_G(h)(z,x)))),\\qquad\\Psi(k)=(Z\\times_G X,Y,((z,x)\\mapsto b_G(k)(z)(x))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E),\\qquad\\Psi=\\Phi^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Psi\\Phi=\\operatorname{id},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\operatorname{id}.","display":true},{"tex":"b_G","display":false},{"tex":"g,k\\in G","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_E(\\rho_E(f,g),k)(x)=f(xk^{-1}g^{-1})gk=\\rho_E(f,gk)(x)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_E(f,g)(xg)=f(x)g","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"b_G(h)(zg,x)=b_G(h)(z,xg^{-1})g","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi(k)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi,\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"Z,Y","display":false}],"bytes":2213,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials|df-198 — 群作用范畴的指数]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials|df-198 — 群作用范畴的指数]]"},{"id":"bbce3cb75d3e9dbc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 沿用 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]] 的拓扑群数据。$i:BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\to BG$ 为满包含。$X=(|X|,\\rho_X)$、$X'=(|X'|,\\rho_{X'})$ 为任意带作用对象，$f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(X,X')$；$b_G$ 见 [[14-df-right-group-actions]]。$X_{\\mathrm{cts}}$ 为下式定义的子集，稳定子精确签名见 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]。$r$ 是以下定义的函子。$W,Y,Z$ 为连续作用对象，$(-)^{(-)}_{BG}$ 采用 [[14-df-group-action-exponentials]] 的带结构指数。$\\iota_X:X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\hookrightarrow|X|$ 为集合包含函数；$v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)$、$k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX)$。"},{"id":"0e7878d33550867c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ff1dddefb4838916"]}